WEBVTT

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:07.090
The time of our great
ambition is upon us.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:07.890
Yes.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.010
The battle on the island
should be ending now.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.780
Once the primary jonin are dead,

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:20.220
all that's left is to take
out the shinobi students here.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.100
It looks like the door to the other
world has opened.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.450
I'll handle this.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:47.560
Naraku-san,

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.730
take Kagura-san and run!

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:05.810
Yumi-chan!

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.340
Asuka-san!

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:10.720
Everyone!

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.970
I'll take out all the youma!

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.970
Don't forget that we're here, too!

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:18.880
Hey!

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:24.840
Yumi!

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.360
We're here!

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:29.090
Looks like things are really bad.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:31.690
But if we work together, it'll be fine!

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:33.890
Yes.

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:34.980
You're right.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.490
Let's go.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.990
It's time to finish this.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:56.010
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:56.760
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:57.470
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:57.800
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.970
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.970
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.440
Yumi-chin,

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:18.590
it's a bad idea to tick youma off, right?

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:19.800
Yes.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:23.090
Weaken them, and then we'll
 have Asuka-san seal them.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:27.010
But there are so many...

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.600
It's pretty hard!

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:32.850
Miyabi!

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:35.780
Have you forgotten the plan?

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:37.100
I told you!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.230
It's a shinobi's job to defeat youma!

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.690
And I'm not straying from that!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:44.410
Ryobi!

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:45.700
Leave it to me!

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:50.360
What?

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:58.380
Asuka!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.970
Don't get in my way!

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.530
These youma are mine!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.390
Come on!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.930
It's too dangerous to lose focus!

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.010
Katsuragi!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.060
If you want to thank me,

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.910
let me feel up your tits later.

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:13.460
But you know...

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:15.400
There are so many.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.400
We can't take them all out one by one.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:21.780
It'll be faster to seal them.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.710
But even if that's true,

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:26.990
