them in one place.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:29.370
There's no way!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.790
No, there is!

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.500
Katsuragi-san,

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:38.040
what's your brilliant plan for
gathering all the youma in one place?

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:42.050
I've got an idea that's
guaranteed to work!

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:45.890
We've got girls that satisfy
a wide variety of tastes!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:47.050
Tastes?

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.560
Class rep!

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:52.390
Gyaru!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:53.660
Flat!

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:55.890
Pervert!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.060
That's so nice of you to say!

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:00.570
Who are you calling flat?

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.120
What?

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:05.360
That laugh was making
fun of me, wasn't it?

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:11.820
What is this?

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:13.310
Katsuragi,

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:14.660
