00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.330
Well you see, Ikaruga...

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:19.580
It's for this!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:29.840
Okay!

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.280
Hey!

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:33.660
What are you thinking?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:34.960
Katsuragi-san,

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:37.420
