00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.500
Listen up.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.600
The youma are after shinobi.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.020
Which means...

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.960
Just like me,

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:46.610
