00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:50.440
Hey, youma!

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:55.620
We've got girls here to satisfy every taste!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.620
Come and enjoy!

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:02.880
You're using us as bait?!

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:04.590
That's right!

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.630
Screw you!

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:12.410
What will become of Ryona-chan?!

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.190
This is seriously bad news!

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:15.890
Katsuragi, raise us up!

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.650
Pull up the rope!

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:27.150
Asuka-san!

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.740
Super Secret Ninja Art:

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.160
Fuma Korin!

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:41.770
Wow...

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.660
I'm s-saved.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:48.670
I hoped they'd at least
give me a butt bite.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.020
Katsuragi-san,

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:51.200
that was mean!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.290
Now, now.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:53.850
It worked, right?

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.940
I thought I was a goner.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:06:59.940
Asuka?

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.460
What's wrong?

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:03.930
You look really pale.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:05.310
Don't worry.

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:06.440
I'm just fine!

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:08.270
You idiot!

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.800
You're not fine!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.520
What is this?

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.290
Is that from using the Fuma Korin?

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.290
It is, isn't it?

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:33.570
It's the only ninja technique
that can seal the youma.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.710
So...

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.800
Asuka!

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:38.990
That's enough.

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:40.110
Stop it.

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:42.170
If you do this any more, you'll...

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:47.410
Sister Katsu, thanks for worrying about me.

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:49.730
But...

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:53.390
I've come this far.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:55.190
Let me see it through to the end.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.070
Please.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.020
Asuka...

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:09.880
Shoot!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:21.050
You took all those youma out at once.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:22.770
Impressive.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:27.130
But the door is still open.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:30.110
You can't stop the youma advance.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.140
I don't care.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:34.360
I'll keep sealing them away.

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:37.450
I won't let you seal any more.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.100
Too easy.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.130
First, crush her hands...

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:01.780
So she can't make the signs
 required for the technique.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:05.210
Stop...

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.400
Asuka-san!

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.700
Yumi...

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.820
Fubuki-san!

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:22.660
I've come to stop you.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:25.410
Yumi-chan...

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:31.700
You say that even after
you've learned everything?

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:34.430
I'm the only one who can.

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.430
Who do you think you are?

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.670
Fubuki!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.050
You'll fight us!

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.590
Hey, Miyabi,

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:45.140
you understand, right?

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.620
If you're telling me not to kill her,

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.810
that's not happening.

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:48.910
What?

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.720
If I hold back,

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.510
