00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:57.900
That's true.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:04.080
Shinobi Transformation!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:20.840
Yumi!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.230
You can't beat me!

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:25.560
Your pride, your spirit...

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.060
Your obsession...

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:28.840
And more than anything,

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:31.940
your hatred does not run as deep as mine!

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.350
She did it...

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:14.030
Mom!

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.440
Father?

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:37.640
Why?

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.690
To slay the youma.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.510
That is the task of a shinobi.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:52.310
It's what I want, too.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.350
No...

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:57.770
No!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.370
Impressive.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.380
You, too.

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:26.390
That's the woman I fell in love with!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.640
That's the man I chose!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:33.070
Stop it!

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:47.620
I'll use my secret ninja art to seal you.

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:50.710
I persuaded the shinobi leaders.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.620
You will no longer be able
to appear in this world,

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:58.950
but they'll guarantee Fubuki's safety.

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:03.130
But if you use that technique,

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.100
your life...

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.880
It's a lot better than killing you.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.330
No!

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:41.000
Super Secret Ninja Art...

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:47.600
Dad! Mom!

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.440
Fubuki...

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:03.500
You're a part of this world.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.030
And that's all that matters.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.050
Live your life with pride.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:12.560
I love you.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.450
And I always will.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.260
Fuma...

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:20.120
Korin.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.840
Dad...

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:33.970
Mom...

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:43.980
Fubuki!

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.490
At least...

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:58.000
I can save this child.

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:18.960
Not a human or a beast...

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:23.090
Is this the youma the jonin spoke of?

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.110
Are you...

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:28.020
a shinobi?

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.520
Yes.

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:31.080
A rogue shinobi.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.030
A rogue shinobi?

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.540
Who's the child?

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.950
She is a youma half-breed.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:40.930
What?

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:44.030
Her name is Fubuki.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.050
Will you take her and keep her safe?

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:51.770
I'm injured and can't protect her.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:54.630
Very well.

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:55.670
I'll do it.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:57.560
Thank you.

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:01.090
Once my wounds heal, I'll come for you.

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.140
Just hang in there until then.

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:11.820
You must be cold.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.330
Let's go home.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:14.420
The enemy...

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.490
The shinobi are my enemy!

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.860
I'll kill them all!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.280
I'll kill them!

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.530
What a coincidence.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:33.330
I used to think the same thing.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.230
<i>Yumi, from now on...</i>

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.730
she'll be living with us.

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.240
Think of her as an older sister
and be kind to her.

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:00.750
Nice to meet you, Big Sister!

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:08.630
Big Sister!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.040
Big Sister!

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:32.850
Here!

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.410
It's good!

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:45.500
Yumi!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:49.770
Yumi...

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:18.530
<i>Happy anniversary,</i>

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.820
Big Sister!

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:25.320
It's been a year since you came here.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.290
<b>Sister Fubuki
 1st Year Anniversary</b>

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:34.980
Here I go!

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:42.300
Just do what your heart tells you to do.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.500
Big Sister!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.420
Homura-chan,

00:18:58.420 --> 00:18:59.900
Miyabi-chan...

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:05.110
I'm not done yet.

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:07.920
I'm just getting started.

00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:10.360
Your arrows are gone.

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:11.940
Your sword is broken.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:14.040
So why do you still fight?

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.100
I...

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.560
won't lose to the power of hatred!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:26.560
Thank you for taking
care of her for so long.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.060
Fubuki...

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:33.050
Did you forget what you must do?

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.570
Grandfather Kurokage,

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:40.610
thank you for everything.

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:47.070
Tell Yumi I'm sorry I didn't say goodbye.

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:57.590
My best friend gave me this.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.570
A sword and a shield.

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:03.580
Everything in this world comes in pairs.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.340
Front and back.

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:06.760
Light and dark.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:08.320
Justice and evil.

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:10.820
And...

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.750
Hatred and love.

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.610
Understand, Fubuki?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:19.820
Hatred and forgiveness are also a pair.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:24.110
Don't follow the path I did.

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:29.220
If you ever feel hatred
threatening to take over,

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:33.520
hold it tight.

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:34.550
Fubuki-san...

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:41.880
What will you do after you destroy
all the shinobi in your hatred?

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:43.440
Nothing.

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:45.630
That is my entire goal.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.640
But what will be left?

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.420
A feeling of accomplishment...

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:53.610
at avenging my hatred.

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:56.430
Then why leave me alive?

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.900
You had many chances to finish me.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:04.210
Shut up. Shut up!

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:08.660
You couldn't get rid of the hairpin
that Grandfather Kurokage gave you.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.660
So I know you understand!

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:15.290
No one can live for hatred alone!

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:17.750
I said shut up!

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:22.220
No matter what you do,

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.930
I'll keep standing up!

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.180
Until you understand, Fubuki-san!

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:32.470
I'll kill you!

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:35.440
Ultimate Secret Ninja Art!

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.760
Ice Queen!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:40.830
Here I go!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.390
Yumi!

00:23:26.890 --> 00:23:27.970
You're too late.

00:23:28.480 --> 00:23:30.970
Yumi is dead.

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:35.200
My goal is to become
the ultimate shinobi!

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:38.810
Snap out of it, Asuka!

00:23:39.130 --> 00:23:41.320
I'll risk my life, too!
